# taste-memory-access

Re-usable TASTE component providing memory access functionality, developed as a part of "Model-Based Execution Platform for Space Applications" project (contract 4000146882/24/NL/KK) financed by the European Space Agency.
The component itself is located in the **component/MemoryAccess** directory. A demonstration projects are provided in **test-project/MemoryAccessDemo** and **test-project/MemoryAccessTest** directory. The component needs an user provided bridge between the component and the rest of TASTE system to properly handle ASN.1 data types.

This project uses parts of source code from Atmel Corporation, licensed on SAM Software Package License.
